        "screen.notContains:Prompt already in progress"
      ],
      "observe": "Three shell commands in one turn queue as approval gates; selecting Trust entire tool on the first gate cascades to the other two pending same-tool requests, so all three run after a single trust action with no further gates.",
      "engine": [
